# Case-insensitive and trailing slash redirects for Contact page (SEO/Google Ads compliance)
/Contact    /contact    301!
/CONTACT    /contact    301!
/contact/   /contact    301!

# Case-insensitive redirects for Team page
/Team       /team       301!
/TEAM       /team       301!
/team/      /team       301!

# SPA Fallback - serves index.html for all client-side routes
# This allows React Router to handle routing on the client side
/*    /index.html   200
